### Feature DoctorSpecialty — CREATE
### Leyenda: JWT + RBAC (login como admin + Authorization: Bearer)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/session/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}

###

# @name createDoctorSpecialty
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor-specialties
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doctor_id": 1,
  "specialty_id": 1,
  "relation_data": "Especialidad principal",
  "status": "active"
}
